Feature: Check Credit # features/check_credit.feature:1

  Scenario: Good Order within credit limit                           # features/check_credit.feature:3
    Given a customer with credit_limit 1000 and balance 0            # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:35
    When an unshipped order is placed with 2 items of unit_price 150 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:99
    Then the item amount is 300                                      # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:187
    And the order amount_total is 300                                # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:194
    And the customer balance is 300                                  # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:201

  Scenario: Alter Item Quantity                                                                 # features/check_credit.feature:10
    Given a customer with credit_limit 1000 and an unshipped order of 2 items at unit_price 150 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:43
    When the item quantity is updated to 4                                                      # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:124
    Then the item amount is 600                                                                 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:187
    And the order amount_total is 600                                                           # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:194
    And the customer balance is 600                                                             # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:201

  Scenario: Change Order Customer                                                        # features/check_credit.feature:17
    Given two customers with credit_limit 1000 and an order of 300 on the first customer # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:83
    When the order is reassigned to the second customer                                  # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:138
    Then the first customer balance is 0                                                 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:208
    And the second customer balance is 300                                               # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:215

  Scenario: Delete Order Item                                                                   # features/check_credit.feature:23
    Given a customer with credit_limit 1000 and an unshipped order of 2 items at unit_price 150 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:43
    When the item is deleted                                                                    # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:152
    Then the order amount_total is 0                                                            # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:194
    And the customer balance is 0                                                               # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:201

  Scenario: Ship Order updates balance                                                          # features/check_credit.feature:29
    Given a customer with credit_limit 1000 and an unshipped order of 2 items at unit_price 150 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:43
    When the order date_shipped is set to "2026-10-27"                                          # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:159
    Then the customer balance is 0                                                              # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:201

  Scenario: Unship Order updates balance                                                     # features/check_credit.feature:34
    Given a customer with credit_limit 1000 and a shipped order of 2 items at unit_price 150 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:58
    When the order date_shipped is cleared                                                   # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:173
    Then the customer balance is 300                                                         # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:201

  Scenario: Exceed Credit Limit fails                                 # features/check_credit.feature:39
    Given a customer with credit_limit 1000 and balance 0             # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:35
    When an unshipped order is placed with 10 items of unit_price 150 # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:99
    Then the transaction is rejected with credit limit constraint     # features/steps/demo_eai_steps.py:222

Feature: Kafka Subscribe Order Integration # features/order_b2b_consume.feature:1

  Scenario: Kafka Consume Valid order_b2b                           # features/order_b2b_consume.feature:3
